  "name": "Runemaster Ancient Warrior shortens Fist of the Ancients on Runeblade and Primordial Blast (#1300)",
  "contract": [
    "Ancient Warrior 520755 (Runic talent, passive): 'Reduces the cooldown of Fist of the Ancients by",
    "$/1000;520757s1 sec whenever you use Runeblade or Primordial Blast.' Its only effect is aura 42 naming 520757,",
    "Ascension effect 165 (modify cooldown) with BasePoints -2001 + DieSides 1 = -2000 ms on MiscValue 712326, rank 1",
    "of Fist of the Ancients. Spell.dbc gives 520755 ProcFlags 0, so SpellMgr generated no proc entry and the talent",
    "never fired. Runeblade ranks carry family 38 mask2 0x40000 (melee class); Primordial Blast ranks carry mask1",
    "0x100000 (magic class). Fist of the Ancients ranks 712326 and 712330-712335 share Category 35 with an 18 sec",
    "RecoveryTime, so a rank 7 Runemaster's cooldown sits on 712335, not on the rank 1 id the effect names.",
    "Expected: each Runeblade or Primordial Blast cast removes 2 sec from the remaining Fist of the Ancients",
    "cooldown of the rank the Runemaster uses; a Runemaster without the talent loses only the elapsed time."
  ],
